  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Erfarenhetsutbyte och undervisningsserier i form av studiebes&#xf6;k och seminarier riktad till personal vid de ryska och ukrainska Migrationsverken. Immigrationskontroll, anl&#xe4;ggningsverksamhet, spr&#xe5;kanalys, intervjuteknik, asylpolitik etc. &#xe4;r temata som behandlas under dessa seminarier. Svensk part &#xe4;r Statens Invandrarverk.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exchange of experinece and training in the field of immigrant reception with personnel from Ukraine and from the Russian Federal Migration Service and Regional Migration Service. Study visits and seminars on immigration control, reception centers, interviewing techniques. Cooperation with the Swedish Immigation Board.</narrative>
  </description>
